{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-ji-horse-theft","title":"孙基盗御马付狱、孙亮问刁玄议罪、赦宫中基得免","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-dbf892b4b69d965eddb4","label":"正文","text":"基侍孙亮在内，太平二年盗乘御马收付狱；亮问侍中刁玄盗乘御马罪，玄对科应死并为基请哀原；亮论法不阿亲亲，从玄言赦宫中，基得免","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0157","role":"盗乘御马被收付狱，因赦得免","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0128","role":"问罪于刁玄并赦宫中","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0021","role":"对以科应死并请哀原、言赦制","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f","source_order":[59,230,0],"order":10486}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0021","name":"刁玄","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0157","name":"孙基","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0128","name":"孙亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-67c9b574ae699782ffe5","layer":"original","quote":"基侍孙亮在内。太平二年，盗乘御马，收付狱。亮问侍中刁玄曰：“盗乘御马，罪云何〖16〗？”玄对曰：“科应死〖17〗。然鲁王早终，惟陛下哀原之。”亮曰：“法者，天下所共，何得阿以亲亲故邪〖18〗！当思惟可以释此者，奈何以情相迫乎？”玄曰：“旧〖19〗，赦有大小；或天下，亦有千里、五百里赦：随意所及。”亮曰：“解人不当尔邪〖20〗！”乃赦宫中，基以得免。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":175}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
